        <h2>Summary / Description</h2>
        <div class="description">
          This Excel file compares a weighted ground-based test score with SMS susceptibility for each of 11 crewmembers on whom data were collected on two or more of the preflight tests. The weighted score is the algebraic sum of the differences between the astronaut's test scores and the normative population means for each test.
<p>
Source: Unpublished data.
        </div>

